  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyala wakumutaŋa waLevi wayili nakusumbula mumbanda wakudi aLevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda wabaabili ivumu, wavweli mwana weyala. Chamumweniyi himwana wawutotombu wamuswekeli tukweji tusatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakaŋenyiyi kumusweka nawa cheŋi, wamutambwilili kawatu kakutuŋananyilela, wakakwitili ndunda niweŋi wamupachi, washilumu mwana, wawŋiŋili mumateti kuchi kumu chakaloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelindi wemeni kwakulehi atali chakamwilawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaFwaro wamumbanda wakunkumukili kukaloŋa nakuwela; atumbanji twindi awambanda akulishili chikumu chakaloŋa; chamweniyi kawatu mukachi kamateti watemesheli kambuŋindi wamumbanda nindi aleti kunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenzulwilumu, wamweni mwana, komana mukeki hakudila. Wamutiyilili wushona, nindi, Himwana kawaHeberu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhelindi wamwilili mwana kaFwaro wamumbanda, nindi, Niyi ni kutambi kili mumbanda wakumulela kudi ambanda awaHeberu kulonda akuleleliyi mwana, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaFwaro wamwilili nindi, Yaŋa. Mwana wamumbanda wayiliwatambi kili mama yamwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaFwaro wamwilili nindi, Mutwaliiwu mwana wumunleleli. Nukukwinkaŋa wufwetu weyi. Mumbanda hakutwala mwana, hakumulelaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wakulili, wamutweli kudi mwana kaFwaro wamumbanda, hakwikala mwanindi. Wanamutumbili ijina dindi, nindi Mosi, nindi, Muloŋa namuzambwili mumeji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku ana, chakuliliyi Mosi, wayili kudi ana kwindi, watalili yiteliyawu. Wamweni kaEjipitu hakweta mana kwindi kaHeberu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watalilininiku niniku, chamweniyi kwosi muntuku wamujahili kaEjipitu, wamuswekeli muwusekulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayiluku nawa ifuku di kwawu damu chiyedi, hakumona amayala ayedi aHeberu hiyakulwisha. Wamwilili wakoŋeli mukwawu chatama, nindi, Wukumweteladi mukwenu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena nindi, Indi eyi nakwilishi mulopu wetu, ninsompeshi yetu, hinyi? Wuneli neyiwunjahi neyi chiwajaha kaEjipitu, tahindi? Mosi watiyili woma, nindi, Komana chumichi anachiluki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fwaro chatiyiliyi chumichi wakeŋa eli kumujaha Mosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Mosi wamutemukili Fwaro, wayili nakushakama mwituŋa daMidiyani; hakushakama kwishima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapristu wakuMidiyani wadiŋi nawanyanindi awambanda atanu nayedi. Ayili nakutaha meji, enzesheli muyizawu, anwishi nyikoku yatata yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atubiŋa ayili nakuyihaŋa, Mosi wanyamukili, wayi kwashiluku, wanwishili nyikoku yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chafuntilu wakudi tata yawu Reyuweli, yena hakuyila nindi, Lelu munanyakelidi kufunta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena nawu, iyala kaEjipitu natupulwishi kudi atubiŋa, natutahili meji, nanwishi anyikoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuyila anyanindi, nindi, Hayodihi? Aka! Munamushiyi nawa! Mutambi kenu enzi kunu adyi yakudya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wetiyili kushakama nayenowu iyala, wamwinkeli mwanindi Zipora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wavweli mwana weyala, Mosi wanamutumbili ijina dindi, nindi Gereshomi, nindi, Muloŋa nashakami muwenyi mwituŋa dambala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woho, mafuku amavulu ahitamu ni kuhitamu, mwanta wakuEjipitu afwa ni kufwa. Anyana kaIsarela ashishumokeli nawudupu wawu, hiyakudila, kudila kwawu kwadililuwu nawuduŋu wawu kwashi kili kudi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi watiyili chakwabawu, Nzambi wa anukili chatiyaŋeniyi dehi naAbarahama, naIsaka, naYakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wamweni anyana kaIsarela, Nzambi washiluhu muchima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
